+		/* A PRP supervision frame is an untagged ETH_P_PRP frame
+		 * (mac_len == ETH_HLEN); its RCT is appended only on egress.
+		 * HSR (ETH_P_HSR) supervision is front-tagged and still must
+		 * contain a struct hsr_ethhdr.
